  },
  "section": "8.5",
  "rulesText": "A creature has six ability scores - Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma - each of which has a corresponding modifier. Add the modifier when you make a D20 Test with the corresponding ability or when a rule asks you to do so. See also “Playing the Game” (“The Six Abilities”).",
